Package: webui
Version: 0.25.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 0xkee
Depends: keenetic-entware-extras, nginx, nginx-mod-lua, logrotate
Description: Custom dashboard for Keenetic/Entware services.
 Provides a web dashboard at port 8080 showing status of
 geo-split, smartdns-geo-conf, and smartdns-redirect services.
 Integrates into stock Keenetic WebUI sidebar via inject.js.
 Includes logrotate config for nginx-webui log rotation.
Section: net
Priority: optional
